# MU Weather needs NO API keys to build or run - all weather data comes from
# keyless public APIs (Open-Meteo forecast/archive/air-quality, MET Norway,
# MeteoAlarm, NWS). The weather features work completely without this file.
#
# The optional AI digest summary uses the USER's own Anthropic or OpenAI key,
# entered in Settings -> AI summary key and kept in the phone's encrypted
# storage (expo-secure-store). There is deliberately no build-time variable for
# it: EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the bundle, so any key placed here
# would ship inside every APK and could be extracted by anyone who downloads it.
#
# The only variable ever used in CI is the EAS CLI token below.
# It is optional: it is only needed for automated Expo Application Services
# builds (CI). For normal development, run `eas login` instead and you do
# not need this file at all.

EXPO_TOKEN=
